I/O","permalink":"/docs/reference/data-io/"}},{"id":"reference/data-io/chunking","title":"Chunking","description":"Chunking splits large documents into smaller pieces that fit within LLM context limits. Agent Actions supports multiple chunking strategies optimized for different use cases.","source":"@site/docs/reference/data-io/chunking.md","sourceDirName":"reference/data-io","slug":"/reference/data-io/chunking","permalink":"/docs/reference/data-io/chunking","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/your-org/agent-actions/tree/main/agentaction-docs/docs/reference/data-io/chunking.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":2,"frontMatter":{"title":"Chunking","sidebar_position":2},"sidebar":"docsSidebar","previous":{"title":"Data Lineage","permalink":"/docs/reference/data-io/data-lineage"},"next":{"title":"Prompt System","permalink":"/docs/reference/prompts/"}},{"id":"reference/data-io/data-lineage","title":"Data Lineage","description":"How does Agent Actions track data as it flows through parallel branches, merges, and splits? The Ancestry Chain provides complete lineage tracking that enables complex workflow patterns like Diamond, Map-Reduce, and Ensemble voting.","source":"@site/docs/reference/data-io/data-lineage.md","sourceDirName":"reference/data-io","slug":"/reference/data-io/data-lineage","permalink":"/docs/reference/data-io/data-lineage","draft":false,"unlisted":false,"editUrl":"https://github.com/your-org/agent-actions/tree/main/agentaction-docs/docs/reference/data-io/data-lineage.md","tags":[],"version":"current","sidebarPosition":4,"frontMatter":{"title":"Data Lineage","sidebar_position":4},"sidebar":"docsSidebar","previous":{"title":"Output Format","permalink":"/docs/reference/data-io/output-format"},"next":{"title":"Chunking","permalink":"/docs/reference/data-io/chunking"}},{"id":"reference/data-io/index","title":"Data I/O","description":"Every agentic workflow needs data to flow in, through, and out. Agent Actions uses a stan